SY_TALK("0P-TjlF1dHo",[[12,["Today we have decided to celebrate the Buddha","Jayanti, it's the day of Buddha's birth."]],[72,["In the whole","map of time, Buddha came to this earth at"]],[89,["a time when it was so important for Him to","come."]],[95,["That time, especially in India, we had two","types of people: one, who were very ritualistic,"]],[117,["trying to be extremely strict and disciplined;","and the another were the people who were"]],[138,["too much conditioned and were full of so-called","devotion to God."]],[149,["So these two types of people were occupying","the area of seekers."]],[166,["So it was necessary to neutralize these two","styles of seekings."]],[177,["Buddha and Mahavira are, in essence, supported","by Hanumana and Bhairava - that is, as you"]],[195,["know, Gabriel and Saint Michael."]],[199,["The principle that took birth is the principle","of a disciple, and this principle was born"]],[212,["much earlier as the two sons of Shri Rama."]],[220,["This principle was brought on this earth and","incarnated: one, to conquer the ego of human"]],[233,["beings; another one, to conquer the superego","of human beings."]],[241,["Buddha, when He was born, He found that there","was misery everywhere."]],[251,["And the misery, according to Him, was due","to the desires we have."]],[260,["So to be desireless is the best way to achieve","Nirvana."]],[267,["That's what He came to conclusion."]],[272,["But how to become desireless?"]],[274,["You are sitting in the sand, and if you see,","the sand doesn't get attached to anything."]],[284,["You put anything on it, it will not spoil","anything."]],[288,["You put water, it will stick on, and as soon","as you try to throw it away the whole thing"]],[297,["will disappear into thin air."]],[302,["So to develop that kind of detachment, or","to develop a life which was desireless was"]],[322,["His aim."]],[323,["And that's why I say He was a Disciple Principles."]],[327,["So, the Disciple Principle has to find out","the way and method, while the Guru Principle"]],[340,["are the people who have already found out."]],[344,["Because He has to create a way and path."]],[347,["So, He studied all kinds of books, went to","many places."]],[354,["He read Upanishadas."]],[356,["Then He saw the people who are busy with Vedas","and were doing all kinds of ritualism."]],[363,["With the rituals, they never got the Realization,","which is actually the first verse of Veda"]],[376,["is that, \"By reading the Vedas and by doing","all the rituals of the Vedas, if you do not"]],[384,["become vida, means self-realized, vida word","means \"to know\", if you don't know the Divine"]],[393,["on your central nervous system, then you are","just missing the point."]],[402,["It is all useless for you to read Vedas."]],[405,["So He went into various areas of search."]],[412,["As today we find many seekers have been going","to many people to find out the truth."]],[424,["And He was tired, very tired."]],[428,["He thought all His seeking, all His working","hard, all His efforts, everything had just"]],[439,["made Him tired."]],[440,["And He thought it was all fruitless."]],[445,["So, He was lying under a Banyan tree, and","there the Adi Shakti gave Him Realization."]],[460,["When all your searches are over - people search","in money, in power, in love, and all kinds"]],[473,["of things."]],[474,["Ultimately people start searching in various","groups, cults, gurus, all kinds of things"]],[483,["- drugs, alcohol's, whichever way are possible","they try to search."]],[489,["But when human beings try to search something,","then in their movement they either go to the"]],[496,["left or to the right."]],[499,["And He, being such an ardent seeker, and such","a truthful seeker, He could see very clearly"]],[509,["that this is not the point of going left or","right."]],[513,["But there has to be some ascent, but how to","achieve it?"]],[517,["Who is going to give Him Self-Realization?"]],[521,["All that tiredness He laid down Himself under","the tree and suddenly He got His Realization."]],[531,["When He got His Realization, He started understanding","why this problem of conditioning and ego is"]],[544,["there."]],[545,["He found out one thing: that people when they","read too much, and try to understand - through"]],[555,["ritualism - God, then they develop their ego."]],[558,["The other side, He found out, that when people","just with some desires, go on praying to God,"]],[567,["\"Give me this, give me that\", they become","mad."]],[573,["And when He realized it, then only at that","moment when He was tired, He got His Realization."]],[582,["This is exactly what is happening today in","the modern times."]],[588,["That those who were seekers have been seeking","the Divine on the left and right hand side."]],[597,["Nowadays they are jogging."]],[601,["I don't know what they're going to achieve","through jogging."]],[604,["They're jogging like mad."]],[607,["Then there are ardent Christians, ardent Muslims,","fighting the whole world for their religion,"]],[614,["for their God, for in the name of Mohammed","Sahib, in the name of Krishna, in the name"]],[620,["of everything."]],[624,["Then they think their religion is in danger."]],[629,["I mean it is not."]],[631,["Neither the prophets nor the incarnations,","nobody is in danger, not at all."]],[639,["How can they be?"]],[643,["And no religion if it is true religion can","be in danger."]],[647,["But this He only realized after His Realization."]],[652,["But His followers who came did not see the","point that ultimately it is Self-Realization"]],[661,["He is talking."]],[664,["Actually he took all the care to see that","people should get their Self-Realization first."]],[669,["Then anything else."]],[670,["First of all He said, \"You are not going to","worship Me.\""]],[675,["As you know we don't allow people to come","for My Puja unless and until they are fully"]],[686,["established in Sahaja Yoga."]],[689,["So He first said that, \"You should be fully","established in your Self-Realization, that's"]],[696,["all.\""]],[697,["He would not talk about God, because once","you start talking about God, then He saw all"]],[706,["these horrible religions coming up in the","name of God."]],[710,["When I first came to America, you will be","surprised, I did not talk of God, I did not"]],[717,["talk of bhoots, I did not talk of any religion."]],[724,["I just talked about Self-Realization."]],[727,["The reason was, I thought, if you get your","Self-Realization then you'll understand the"]],[735,["rest of it, but no use talking to you -"]],[748,["about God or about Divine because first thing","is you must have your eyes, you must have"]],[758,["the light, otherwise what's the use of talking","about these things."]],[762,["But it so happened that Buddha did not give","anybody Realization."]],[767,["So it was all right for Him to talk about","the Spirit and not about God or any religion,"]],[774,["to such an extent that people say that Buddha","was an atheist - He did not believe in God."]],[781,["No, it was a matter of His policy that He","did not want to talk about God."]],[790,["But what I found when I came to America that","this world is full of all kinds of things."]],[799,["Firstly the tremendous ego that they have."]],[804,["And secondly they are so much conditioned."]],[808,["There were so many witchcrafts and forces,","I mean openly they are saying, \"This is a"]],[820,["witchcraft's school.\""]],[821,["Openly."]],[822,["Or, \"This is a satanic powers school.\""]],[826,["All kinds, I was surprised, openly saying","like that."]],[830,["And when I came to San Diego first, because","I came on My own, and the people who invited"]],[837,["Me had an organization called \"parapsychology\"","- is all bhoots."]],[844,["So they took Me round in a huge, big hall","and there were lots of people sitting down"]],[851,["and I saw all the bhoots."]],[854,["(Shri Mataji laughing) I said, \"Now what should","I do?"]],[857,["Should I say the truth or not?"]],[858,["They might start getting angry with Me.\""]],[861,["But I said, \"Better to tell them, because","once they are lost in the bhoots, then what"]],[867,["will I do with them?\""]],[869,["So I told them, \"This is all wrong, this is","all bhootish, it is all nonsense, you just"]],[873,["don't fall a prey to all these things, this","is not correct, you better get your Realization!\""]],[880,["And see, some people did get Realization,","and some people did leave that organization."]],[886,["Now, last time when I came I discovered in","'83 that the lady who was in charge sort of"]],[898,["a person, has become mad and the gentleman","who was organizing all that has become bankrupt"]],[909,["and has gone to Australia and the building","has collapsed."]],[914,["The bhoots must have done the job."]],[918,["It was such a problem for Me in those days","to talk against all this nonsense."]],[927,["Then I went to some churches, they invited","Me."]],[928,["Now, in the church suddenly I found eight","or ten bhootish people got up and started"]],[935,["dancing."]],[936,["I said, \"Where am I now?\""]],[939,["(Shri Mataji laughing &amp; laughter) I am here to","tell them about the Spirit and see the condition"]],[947,["here."]],[948,["What am I to tell them and they ardently","believed that I was an agent of God, of course,"]],[955,["but God meaning bhoot."]],[957,["It was impossible to understand how far people","have gone."]],[964,["At the same time there was an onslaught of","all the fake gurus at that time and when I"]],[972,["said, \"You cannot pay for it\" they said, \"You","better go back."]],[978,["We don't want you.\""]],[980,["So I went away and then came back after nine","years."]],[986,["So Buddha tried to talk only about Self-Realization","and not about God at all."]],[996,["But His followers as they are always one better","than the other, tried to create a Buddhism"]],[1006,["of their own style."]],[1010,["And in this Buddhism, whatever He had told,","they did not observe it."]],[1015,["Firstly He thought if there is ritualism and","puja an all that, before Realization where"]],[1021,["will they land up?"]],[1024,["So He said, \"All right, you do not do any","puja to Me!"]],[1032,["Do not built any monument in My name!"]],[1035,["You should not worship anything!\""]],[1040,["So what did they do?"]],[1041,["They are worshipping His teeth, they are worshipping","His nails, they are worshipping His hair."]],[1049,["Now say, for example, if you get My hair and","you are not a Realized Soul, what is the difference"]],[1060,["between My hair or anybody's hair?"]],[1062,["Just the same."]],[1065,["Without Realization all this worship took","them to very bhootish area."]],[1071,["That's how we find the Buddhists who are nowhere","near Buddha."]],[1078,["Like if you go to Japan, you can't believe","they can be Buddhist."]],[1083,["They are supposed to be Buddhist - Buddha","who is the compassionate."]],[1089,["Then we have got Chinese who followed Buddhism."]],[1096,["They couldn't understand Buddhism either."]],[1099,["And we have Tibetans where we had these horrible","lamas and we had other people in Ladakh and"]],[1107,["all that."]],[1108,["They are all doing nothing else but bhoot-vidya,","prita-vidya, smashaan vidya."]],[1115,["So even His advent amounted to the same thing","as everybody's."]],[1120,["Now Buddha told three things which are very","important, which are very useful for Sahaja"]],[1131,["Yogis to follow."]],[1133,["He said, \"Buddham Sharanam Gachami."]],[1142,["- I surrender myself to the enlightened one.\""]],[1148,["Means what?"]],[1149,["I surrender myself to the one who is enlightened."]],[1154,["In this case one can say it was Buddha."]],[1158,["In your case it is your Spirit."]],[1162,["You surrender yourself to your Spirit."]],[1166,["\"Buddham Sharanam Gachami.\""]],[1168,["Buddha means the one which knows."]],[1172,["Then He says another thing, \"Dhammam Sharanam","Gachami\" means surrender yourself to the religion,"]],[1182,["which is true religion, which is the balance."]],[1186,["Now as you see, all these man-made religions","are so funny and you can't make much out of"]],[1195,["them."]],[1196,["You can't explain if these are religions or these","are Mafias."]],[1202,["The reason is, Buddha said, \"You surrender","yourselves to Dharma.\""]],[1214,["So the Buddhist thought, \"surrender to Dharma\"","means what you have to do is to become like"]],[1221,["Buddhist - means wear a dress like a Buddhist,","like Buddha used to wear."]],[1228,["You don't become by wearing that dress Buddha,","do you?"]],[1234,["Or then they thought, \"We should do something","more.\""]],[1237,["So some Buddhist got hold of a wheel, because","He talked of a wheel-of-life and all that."]],[1246,["Absolutely, I should say, very unintelligent","way of understanding Buddha."]],[1254,["And they would go on, you see, moving that","wheel like mad."]],[1258,["You can't talk to them."]],[1261,["You say, \"Now, where is that road?\""]],[1264,["\"Buddha.\""]],[1265,["(Laughter) \"How do we go there?\""]],[1268,["(Laughter) Everything has an answer."]],[1271,["So I said, \"Please answer Me.\""]],[1275,["\"This is the answer.\""]],[1278,["So what is this answer going on?"]],[1285,["Then these people thought we should find out","new methods."]],[1289,["So some of them took to again Upanishadas","and started using also from there, making"]],[1299,["jataka kathas like the stories which are very","absurd, funny stories, mysterious stories,"]],[1308,["this story, that story."]],[1311,["At the same time Hinduism took another funny","role and they had a big assault of tantrikas."]],[1324,["And when the tantrikas came in they brought","all kinds of ugly, horrible things in the"]],[1334,["- say about the sixth century it started."]],[1341,["And a complete belt starting beyond Calcutta","going towards Dwarika, complete belt got involved"]],[1354,["into tantrism."]],[1356,["So the same Buddhist later on, followed the","same tantric methods."]],[1362,["So they tried to bring in everything from","this place, that place and a mixture, so now"]],[1370,["if you ask, \"Now what's your religion?\" they","say, \"I'm Buddhist.\""]],[1376,["\"What Buddhist?\""]],[1377,["- \"Dinayan, hinayan,"]],[1379,["I'm Zen - this, that, all kinds of Buddhism is","there."]],[1385,["Is impossible to understand really where is","Buddhism there."]],[1390,["So what do these do?"]],[1391,["One will shave their hair."]],[1393,["One will shave their moustache."]],[1395,["Another one will wear this kind of a dress."]],[1398,["(Shri Mataji laughing) This is the only difference","between from one to another."]],[1402,["But the common point is that they are all","cheats, they all can deceive you, they can"]],[1409,["tell lies without feeling funny."]],[1411,["They are very sly, very cunning and suicidal."]],[1415,["They can be very violent and the only desire","they have is to kill everybody who comes across."]],[1424,["This is where Buddha's Buddhism has ended","up."]],[1432,["So now we are face to face with Buddha."]],[1438,["But what He talked about was a spontaneous","happening of Self-Realization."]],[1445,["And He said, \"You prepare yourself.\""]],[1448,["All the time He said, \"You prepare yourself","for Self-Realization and try to watch everything"]],[1455,["without desire.\""]],[1456,["This was just preparation for Sahaja Yoga","He was talking about."]],[1461,["But as you see, all the Buddhists today, if","you see them you'll be amazed that they are"]],[1475,["neither here nor there."]],[1477,["You just don't know how to place them, how","to understand them, how to make them feel"]],[1483,["what Buddha taught or Zen has taught."]],[1485,["They are not in a condition to understand","anything."]],[1490,["It's like, you see, the brain of a person","who is having all kinds of thoughts, like"]],[1499,["all the pebbles in one little pot, making","noise."]],[1504,["God knows which one is making which noise."]],[1508,["And that's why today you find here is one","Lama, who was a guru of Hitler."]],[1515,["Imagine: Hitler's guru was Lama!"]],[1518,["Now this mister Lama is going round the whole","world with his wrinkles which can be counted"]],[1524,["one by one and asking for money."]],[1527,["Why does he want money for?"]],[1529,["He is the one who ran away from Tibet, from","Lhasa."]],[1539,["And while running away he carried such a lot","of gold with him that he could not carry."]],[1543,["So half of it he dropped it in the river and","with the half of it he reached India."]],[1548,["With the half of it already he has made a","huge, big Buddha of gold, he has too much"]],[1555,["gold with him."]],[1556,["And the rest of the gold that was salvaged,","was taken to Russia - to China, where I've"]],[1565,["seen it Myself."]],[1567,["Amazed."]],[1568,["He had gold, beer mugs, what you call","them, the huge, big things, like that."]],[1576,["Real gold."]],[1577,["And such big plates of real gold for eating","food."]],[1582,["Imagine!"]],[1583,["Buddha talked of detachment, and they had","everything in gold or silver of a very expensive"]],[1592,["quality."]],[1594,["If you see their robe, clothes and all that","you'd be amazed."]],[1597,["Though they wore all those things as robes","of renunciation, but whenever they sat in"]],[1606,["their own courtyard - courts and things like","that, inside all that they wore - inside wore"]],[1614,["all those dresses which were very heavily","done with real gold, with pearls and things,"]],[1622,["because I've seen with My own eyes."]],[1628,["I was amazed."]],[1631,["So it is like somebody who says, \"Oh, I must","get detached."]],[1635,["Now I'm going to the seashore."]],[1637,["I'm going to sit there and meditate.\""]],[1640,["There he goes, and makes a compound round","himself."]],[1643,["So I ask him, \"Why have you made a compound?\", \"You","know, maybe thieves might come in.\""]],[1648,["I mean you are detached what does it matter","if a thief comes, he will take you away, so"]],[1653,["what?"]],[1654,["You are there, doesn't matter, you can go","with a thief, you can go with anyone."]],[1657,["Why are you worried about the thief?"]],[1659,["You are detached."]],[1660,["\"Oh, you see, I am also worried that there","might be pick-pockets.\""]],[1664,["\"So why are you worried about pick-pockets?\""]],[1667,["\"Because maybe I have some money with me here,","and I have my bank account and I have my other, other"]],[1674,["things with me, so I am rather worried, see,","that a thief might come.\""]],[1679,["So why do you talk of detachment?"]],[1682,["Why do you talk of sanyasa?"]],[1684,["So this kind of a nonsensical sanyasa started","after Buddha died, which was so very shocking."]],[1694,["This led people to think that you can wear","any time an orange dress and then you are"]],[1703,["a sanyasi."]],[1704,["If you wear an orange dress you become Buddha,","and you become a detached personality."]],[1708,["Now you can announce to the whole world that,","\"I'm a detached personality\" and what is your"]],[1716,["background?"]],[1717,["\"Nothing, I just was born out of this Mother","Earth and I'm sitting here nicely like Buddha.\""]],[1722,["So people stupidly start giving them money."]],[1726,["So they get the money."]],[1728,["But actually, the background is that the fellow","might have come out of the jail in India for"]],[1734,["burglary or something like that, and now sitting","down here as Buddha."]],[1740,["How will you make out?"]],[1743,["\"Buddham Sharanam Gachami.\""]],[1748,["So what we have to do is to establish ourselves","in Buddha."]],[1754,["That is to establish within ourselves in our","Spirit."]],[1759,["Unless and until we are established in our","Spirit, we cannot understand the intricacies"]],[1767,["of all the ignorance that we have around."]],[1773,["So the best way to understand Sahaja Yoga","is to establish yourself in the Spirit."]],[1780,["But those who are not intelligent, those who","are stupid, those who are selfish and greedy"]],[1789,["do not see this point."]],[1792,["And they do not like it if a leader tells","them that, \"You must establish in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1800,["that you should have your Spirit manifested.\""]],[1803,["They don't want to listen to it."]],[1805,["They want to be in the group of Sahaja Yogis","because they don't want to be lonely."]],[1811,["They would like to sing songs, music, everything","in Sahaja Yoga because they want somewhere"]],[1819,["to fit in, because they want an identity,","they call themselves Sahaja Yogis."]],[1826,["But this identity is a false identity."]],[1831,["You have to be identified with your Spirit."]],[1835,["That is the part is, \"Buddham Sharanam Gachami.\""]],[1840,["The second is, \"Dhammam Sharanam Gachami.\""]],[1845,["What is \"Dhammam\", is Dharma."]],[1847,["What is our Dharma, is Vishwa Nirmala Dharma."]],[1851,["That means now we have become universal beings."]],[1855,["We are no more Indians, no more Africans,","no more English, no more French."]],[1865,["We all have become now Sahaja Yogis who are","the citizens of the Kingdom of God."]],[1879,["We have no other identification."]],[1883,["This is our Dharma."]],[1885,["We are now leading a universal life."]],[1892,["But Sahaja Yogis are not like that."]],[1900,["Still, so many of them still identify themselves","with some localized stuff."]],[1907,["Now when we think of universality we have","to understand, that it's not only the religion"]],[1916,["or a country that separates us, but also a","kind of a quality."]],[1923,["For example, if there are people who are Rajo-gunis","who are very active, right-sided people, they'll"]],[1930,["combine together."]],[1931,["They may fight later but they combine."]],[1934,["Then the people who are left-sided will combine","together, but both of these should cling onto"]],[1942,["those who are trying to ascend, who are in","the center."]],[1951,["And there where we fail very much."]],[1954,["Our associations and our understandings of","each other is deluded by our ignorance and"]],[1966,["we cannot understand who is for our ascent","and who is for our benevolence."]],[1980,["This happens with us in so many ways."]],[1984,["We are universal beings and our culture is","\"Sahaja Culture.\""]],[1990,["We have given up all our nonsensical cultures."]],[1993,["In every religion, in every country we have","seen the nonsense of our culture, so we believe"]],[2001,["in the spontaneous culture of Sahaja Yoga."]],[2005,["So we are universal beings."]],[2008,["And in this state of being universal being","you have to develop your collective consciousness."]],[2018,["As first one is for individual, \"Buddham Sharanam","Gacchami\" - I surrender myself to Buddha."]],[2029,["The second one is the one, I surrender myself","to the collective - in the sense, into the"]],[2037,["Dharma, the essence of the collective."]],[2040,["Now what is the essence of our collective?"]],[2044,["What binds us together is Vishwa Nirmala Dharma,","the Pure Religion of the Universe."]],[2051,["So once you understand that this is the thing","that binds you to each other, you must understand"]],[2059,["how important it is to keep to Vishwa Nirmala","Dharma."]],[2064,["In so many ways I have been able to tell you","what is Vishwa Nirmala Dharma."]],[2072,["So we have to understand the full content","of the Dharma that we are following and also"]],[2083,["to reflect it back to see, \"Are we really","following this religion?\""]],[2090,["But in falsehood I have seen like somebody's","a Christian."]],[2094,["Every Sunday he'll get up, dress up nicely,","go to the church, get up three times, four"]],[2100,["times, sing songs, this thing, do everything,","pay the money to the priest, pay to the church,"]],[2105,["pay to that, and then he thinks he has done","the job."]],[2114,["Very religiously he'll go and confess."]],[2117,["Muslims, very religiously will do some things","which we cannot really understand."]],[2122,["As in Spain I was told that people try","to crucify themselves, as a drama of course,"]],[2130,["but they do it just to protect Christianity","I think, and to crucify - God knows what!"]],[2138,["Then there are people in India who are following","Hinduism and the first principle, the basic"]],[2146,["principle of Hinduism, that there is Spirit","in everyone."]],[2150,["So how can you have caste and subcaste and this and that?"]],[2155,["If everybody has the Spirit you can't have","caste, subcaste."]],[2159,["You cannot have division like that."]],[2163,["So what we find in every religion, there are","problematic things but once you come to this"]],[2170,["pure religion, then you see the essence of","it and the essence of it is that, that we"]],[2177,["are all Spirit and we are all related to each","other, we are part and parcel of the whole."]],[2184,["So you go to the collective."]],[2186,["So at the end He said, \"Sangham Sharanam Gachami.\""]],[2190,["This is the very important point also."]],[2194,["It's the most important thing is this \"Sangham","Sharanam Gachami.\""]],[2202,["For example, we say that you surrender yourself","to collectivity."]],[2210,["What does that mean?"]],[2211,["What does that entail (it is)?"]],[2212,["As I was talking to your leaders here, I said,","\"All of you should form one collective unit,"]],[2223,["a 'Sangham'.\""]],[2224,["All the leaders have to know that they love","Mother from their heart, and they should never"]],[2232,["try to cut each other because somebody's trying","to tell them against them."]],[2243,["They should have love for each other."]],[2246,["For example there's one Mr. X, who's a leader."]],[2248,["Now a negative force incarnates and comes","and tells the leader that, \"See the other"]],[2257,["leader is my supporter.\""]],[2258,["So this fellow has a bad feeling, the another","leader has another bad feeling."]],[2265,["This is going against \"Sangha.\""]],[2267,["First the Sangha of the collectivity of the","leaders has to be fully appreciated."]],[2274,["I enjoy the way when all these leaders meet","and beat each other nicely and enjoy each"]],[2279,["other, pull each other's legs and love each","other and patronize the younger ones and look"]],[2288,["after."]],[2289,["That's the beginning of Sangha."]],[2290,["If the leaders are not in Sangha, what other","Sangha we can form?"]],[2295,["So the first is the Sangha of the leaders","is there."]],[2298,["All those who try to break that Sangha must","know that they are negative people and they"]],[2304,["are going to stab us."]],[2307,["Anybody who tries that, you should be very","careful."]],[2312,["The second Sangha, collectivity, is among","the Sahaja Yogis."]],[2317,["Now we are not, as I told you, Indians, or","we are not English or Americans or anything,"]],[2326,["so we should not form groups."]],[2328,["What you'll find always, if there are five","Americans they'll stick on to each other as"]],[2335,["if they have been glued, and they can't move","away from each other."]],[2339,["All of them will be together."]],[2340,["If there are Indians, they will stick on together."]],[2345,["If there are other kinds, they'll all stick","on together."]],[2350,["Now we are no more that."]],[2353,["It's finished!"]],[2354,["So what is there to glue to each other?"]],[2357,["But it happens."]],[2358,["We always glue to each other."]],[2360,["I don't know why."]],[2363,["What is the need to do that?"]],[2365,["And very commonly we see that in India people","are behaving in a very funny manner."]],[2372,["Last year I did not know, but people told","Me that some group came and they were all"]],[2378,["the time saying, \"We are a great nation, we","are a great nation.\""]],[2386,["They are not Sahaja Yogis."]],[2390,["Our nation is Kingdom of God and our King","is God Almighty and we have no other King"]],[2401,["and no other nation."]],[2403,["If you cannot transcend those barriers of","stupid limitations you cannot become Sahaja"]],[2414,["Yogis."]],[2415,["But this is in a very gross way."]],[2418,["But in a very subtle way, I see a lady who","is catching or who has badha will immediately"]],[2428,["crawl into another one - somehow."]],[2430,["She may belong to any country, doesn't matter."]],[2434,["You see, a bhootish woman, say, coming from","India, will crawl up to another one in Australia."]],[2443,["Straight forward, march!"]],[2445,["Just start watching, \"Where is she going?"]],[2449,["Oh God, that's it!\""]],[2451,["So the bhoots are very collective, a big fraternity,","great fraternity."]],[2458,["If they see somebody who is possessed, this","bhootish person will immediately go to her."]],[2463,["It is very surprising that the bhoots are","so collective."]],[2471,["Apart from that, they know Me very well."]],[2475,["They understand Me very well."]],[2477,["Even a little child if he is caught up will","start crying before Me, shaking before Me,"]],[2484,["not coming before Me."]],[2485,["But when they are realized, they don't understand","and moreover they don't understand a simple"]],[2492,["principle that we are now possessed by our","own Spirit and we are one."]],[2498,["So they should stick on more to the person","who is a spiritually evolved personality."]],[2509,["But instead of that, for them some \"third-rater\"","something is much more important than a person"]],[2517,["who is such a highly developed person."]],[2521,["This is where we fail in our collective."]],[2524,["A very subtle method of these negative people."]],[2529,["Just finding out how to form a big formidable","group to attack."]],[2534,["With that you lose your vibrations."]],[2539,["Once you lose your vibrations then you say,","\"Oh, this is too much."]],[2547,["We must have compassion."]],[2548,["We must have love."]],[2550,["After all we are all Sahaja Yogis.\""]],[2554,["So it's the compassion and love of bhoots","among themselves."]],[2560,["They are talking of compassion to each other."]],[2564,["Even with Me they said, \"Mother, you have","to be kind.\""]],[2570,["I said, \"Are you more compassionate than Me","that you are teaching Me?\""]],[2578,["If I'm saying anything to this lady taking","all My breath and all My energy on her, then"]],[2587,["I'm doing it for her benevolence and it's","My compassion that is [why/working], but what you"]],[2592,["are doing is not for the benevolence but for","the destruction of that person."]],[2601,["So no use supporting someone who is negative."]],[2607,["Many negative persons who have been asked","to get out of Sahaja Yoga sometimes create"]],[2612,["this problem of coming, \"Oh Mother, you know,","I'm so good, but they tortured me, they troubled"]],[2619,["me so much.\""]],[2620,["Now I'm seeing a bhoot in the person."]],[2622,["I can clearly see."]],[2624,["I can see the negativity, but if you do not","see, you will immediately start taking sides,"]],[2631,["\"Oh God, look at this, poor thing is tortured.\""]],[2636,["You lose your vibrations, you won't be able","to find out!"]],[2642,["So don't come under the spell of these murmuring","souls, as Christ has called."]],[2647,["He said, \"Murmuring souls are the greatest","danger.\""]],[2652,["That I've seen in Sahaja Yoga."]],[2654,["Those who murmur, talk at the back, go on","complaining are the greatest danger to Sahaja"]],[2662,["Yoga and ultimately to themselves."]],[2665,["Because they'll be found out."]],[2668,["So this is the another situation into which","we are not collective and when we are collective,"]],[2678,["we are collective for something which is not","ascending force."]],[2686,["It is something surprising how we see people","in this world are inviting their destruction"]],[2699,["and we too, in a way, when we don't understand","what is collectivity, try to destroy our body"]],[2710,["of Sahaja Yoga."]],[2714,["Today I'm telling you this because all these","things must be stopped now on the day of Buddha's"]],[2721,["birth."]],[2723,["Buddha is the one who is in charge of your","ego."]],[2729,["If you go beyond Buddha and start showing","off too much, then He pushes your ego into"]],[2738,["your left Vishuddhi."]],[2739,["So you develop your left Vishuddhi and when","you develop your left Vishuddhi, what happens?"]],[2745,["That you start feeling guilty, meaning you","do not want to face the situation at all,"]],[2750,["but you say \"Oh, I'm very guilty."]],[2753,["I've killed you, all right, I've killed you,","I'm feeling guilty.\""]],[2758,["We never face the situation."]],[2761,["This is the ego which goes into the left and","creates this problem of left Vishuddhi."]],[2766,["It's not by any chance your style of bearing","up things, or you are being suppressed."]],[2774,["But no, you have been oppressing others, you","have been egoistical and it has been so much"]],[2785,["that it has gone into the left Vishuddhi."]],[2793,["So you are trying to justify."]],[2795,["Now I would suggest that if you really want","to understand Sahaja Yoga, first try to understand"]],[2803,["yourself."]],[2805,["Then you see, \"Where is my mind going now?\""]],[2811,["Some ladies who are used to, say gossip, they","come to Sahaja Yoga."]],[2816,["They are all right, but sometimes that thing","comes, \"Let's go and gossip about this lady\"."]],[2823,["They'll just get up, walk on to another one who","must have been gossiped in last life, maybe."]],[2829,["So go and talk to that person and tell something","against that person."]],[2835,["(Shri Mataji laughing) Then they find out","another gossiper or they get another gossiper."]],[2843,["Now, what I find is three great Sahaja Yoginis","are sitting and gossiping there."]],[2847,["I say, \"What are you talking?\""]],[2848,["\"Oh, no Mother, we were discussing Sahaja","Yoga.\""]],[2854,["I said, \"Really?\""]],[2856,["(Laughter) Discussing Sahaja Yogis is never","discussion on Sahaja Yoga."]],[2866,["If you are discussing people you are not discussing","Sahaja Yoga."]],[2871,["Discussing Sahaja Yoga has nothing to do with","human beings or with Realized souls."]],[2880,["Thank God, you don't discuss Me, because I","must be making lots of mistakes."]],[2888,["In relation to your culture, in relation to","your styles, in relation to the human style."]],[2895,["For example, you have to say, \"Thank you\"","ten times."]],[2898,["I might be saying it only three times or four","times."]],[2902,["Or you have to say, \"Sorry, sorry, sorry,","sorry.\""]],[2905,["On the telephone even now, I never say sorry,","I say, \"I beg your pardon?\""]],[2910,["But you see, people will say, \"Sorry, sorry,","sorry.\""]],[2913,["I start thinking, \"Am I in the wrong or they","are in the wrong?\""]],[2919,["(Laughter)"]],[2920,["So when we start discussing others, what we","really do is to confront or to face someone"]],[2934,["with your own limitations."]],[2936,["And we start thinking, \"He should have done","like this, he should have ...\" What about"]],[2944,["you?"]],[2945,["So best is, you discuss yourself with yourself","and you discuss Sahaja Yoga with others."]],[2954,["This is the best way to get rid of one of","the greatest enemies of collectivity, is gossip."]],[2959,["Is a human nature, you know, I think, to gossip."]],[2966,["Another horrible thing we have, which Buddha","has tried to control, is a very subtle type"]],[2976,["of aggressiveness."]],[2979,["That one of the games I play is of making","somebody a leader."]],[2984,["It's a game, please remember."]],[2986,["Even if I tell you, \"I'm Mahamaya\", you forget","it."]],[2989,["Even if I tell you, \"I'm playing a game\",","still you forget it."]],[2994,["You become so seriously leaders, you see."]],[2996,["It's nothing to feel that you are leaders,","there's nothing like leaders, there's nothing"]],[3000,["like that in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3002,["But then I praise some."]],[3006,["Now I had a mind to praise people today for","yesterday's program."]],[3012,["The way it was arranged, the way it was done","beautifully, so many people came, is remarkable."]],[3017,["But then I was thinking, \"Should I say or","not?\""]],[3022,["(Laughter) If I say, next time, God knows","what I will see."]],[3031,["(Laughter) So encouraging like this, will","it help or not?"]],[3039,["So I've been still discreet about it."]],[3042,["Of course, I must say, yesterday's program","was very remarkable and we must really give"]],[3048,["a hand to Dave and to the leader, our Karan."]],[3058,["(Applause)"]],[3060,["Despite all stupid opposition and nonsense,","they have shown how they have brought in so"]],[3079,["many people to Sahaja Yoga and how with complete","concentration they have been able to establish"]],[3086,["so many in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3092,["So it is for you to learn from it, that despite","all problems and anything, without feeling"]],[3101,["bad about it, just see that you move like","a big elephant towards giving Realization"]],[3110,["to others, creating more Sahaja Yogis and","more Sahaja Yogis in America."]],[3121,["Those who had this aim in life that we have","to give Realization to people, we have to"]],[3128,["achieve establishment of Sahaja Yoga, they","never will have any problems of any kind."]],[3139,["So never bring down yourself to the level","where you think that, \"See, the food was not"]],[3146,["good, that was not good, this one was not","good, this fellow was torturing, that fellow"]],[3152,["was doing this.\""]],[3155,["Nothing."]],[3156,["This is not going to help you, help anyone."]],[3158,["Not going to give you any marks, as they say."]],[3163,["After all if you have to enter into the Kingdom","of God, one has to know that you have to have"]],[3168,["certain marks."]],[3169,["Otherwise God will say, \"You failed\", (Laughter)","and you'll be surprised why the entrance is"]],[3176,["not allowed."]],[3177,["You are thinking you are so intelligent, so","great, you see, how much gossip you have created,"]],[3183,["how much problems you have created, how many","leaders you have pulled down, how much you"]],[3188,["have befooled Mother and all that."]],[3191,["(Laughter) And there suddenly you find, \"I've","failed."]],[3195,["(Laughter) What has happened?\""]],[3198,["So don't deceive your Self."]],[3202,["Self is the Spirit."]],[3205,["Don't deceive your Self."]],[3208,["If you deceive yourself, ultimately you will","be deceived and despite the fact you have"]],[3214,["been Sahaja Yogis, you have been to My Puja,","you have been here and you have been certified"]],[3220,["as Sahaja Yogis, there's light on your head,","still they will say, \"Take another life,"]],[3224,["and then come back."]],[3226,["Take another as, you see, failed, you have","to go through one year more."]],[3235,["Try another one.\""]],[3238,["(Laughter)"]],[3239,["So the easiest way to be a good Sahaja Yogi,","not to deceive your Self."]],[3244,["Watch yourself!"]],[3246,["Where is this mind going?"]],[3250,["What am I thinking?"]],[3251,["What is my mind working now?"]],[3253,["Can I, this man is coming, can I give him","Realization?"]],[3261,["Should I start talking to him about Sahaja Yoga?"]],[3263,["Sitting in the train, you watch a person."]],[3266,["\"Ah, this is all right!"]],[3269,["Let's manage this fellow.\""]],[3272,["All the time you have to catch human beings","like fishes are caught."]],[3279,["I've taught you how to do it."]],[3284,["To go on catching them, one by one, and create","a greater collectivity."]],[3289,["If your attention is on that, then I will","say, \"You have acted like Buddha\", because"]],[3302,["Buddha just did that."]],[3306,["From everywhere He collected people, told","them to follow a path of detachment and He"]],[3312,["asked them to wear clothes and things which","are for detachment."]],[3317,["And He asked that you should detach yourself","from your families, everything."]],[3323,["This, all this, He did for one thing, that","they should be prepared for today's life."]],[3330,["That they've done all these things, but we","don't want you to wear orange dresses, we"]],[3337,["don't want you to do all these wrong things,","which are not needed today."]],[3345,["They were all right in those days, but today","they are wrong because they are not needed."]],[3351,["When it is not needed, why should you carry","on your head?"]],[3357,["Like the other day, I saw somebody carrying","a big boat on his head."]],[3361,["I said, \"What are you doing?\""]],[3363,["He said, \"I'm carrying the boat.\""]],[3365,["\"For what?"]],[3366,["Why are you carrying the boat?\""]],[3368,["Said, \"You see, I know there is no need to","carry the boat here because there is no sea,"]],[3374,["no water, nothing, but I'm just carrying.\""]],[3377,["(Laughter) \"But why are you carrying this","load upon your head?\""]],[3384,["\"Ah, because I'm carrying, you know.\""]],[3390,["(Laughter)"]],[3391,["That is how we are."]],[3393,["We are carrying on with things which are not","needed."]],[3397,["Like, \"Mother, now I've been doing Hatha Yoga,","should I do some Hatha Yoga?\""]],[3402,["\"But why do you want to do it?"]],[3406,["There is no need for you.\""]],[3408,["\"No, no, Mother, but I've been doing it.\""]],[3413,["(Laughter) \"So do it now, what to do?\""]],[3417,["It's as stupid as this carrying a boat on","your head, that whatever is not needed unnecessarily"]],[3423,["wasting your time."]],[3426,["\"I'm used to this, Mother, I used to do this,","so I must do it.\""]],[3434,["Everything is made very easy for you in Sahaja","Yoga."]],[3438,["Very simple."]],[3439,["You don't have to starve, you don't have to","fast, you don't have to become vegetarians,"]],[3444,["you don't have to go and sit in the sun or","meditate on Himalayas."]],[3450,["Nothing of the kind."]],[3452,["Comfortably you can sit down wherever you","like and you can meditate."]],[3457,["Everything made easy."]],[3460,["And once you've found out your Spirit, you","can enjoy everything that's beautiful."]],[3468,["Now on the whole, maybe for some people this","is really too much."]],[3473,["In a Sahara Desert you are sitting, everything","blowing on your head."]],[3479,["\"What is this?"]],[3480,["How can we live here?"]],[3481,["Such a rough life!\""]],[3484,["But you don't feel that way, because you have","the comfort of the Spirit within you."]],[3489,["It's the comfort of the Spirit."]],[3492,["And for the comfort of Spirit you don't need","anything, that's what you have."]],[3499,["So do not carry on with nonsensical things."]],[3504,["Because Buddha went round and round."]],[3506,["As we came today to this program, I was just","thinking like Buddha."]],[3510,["Going from this end, again coming from this","end, then I couldn't find it, then that end,"]],[3515,["then coming this way."]],[3516,["Ultimately we reached here, they said it's blocked!"]],[3518,["I said, \"Give him a bandhan.\""]],[3523,["Finished, open!"]],[3525,["So this was blocked, that was blocked, go","this way, that way."]],[3528,["All right, it was blocked for Him."]],[3530,["So He went round and round."]],[3533,["But it's not blocked for you."]],[3535,["Why do you want to go round and round again?"]],[3538,["But that is what today everybody wants to","do the same way."]],[3540,["\"We must sacrifice, we must give up this,","we must do that.\""]],[3543,["What are you going to sacrifice?"]],[3545,["What is there to sacrifice?"]],[3548,["I would like to know in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3558,["Of course, mostly people sacrifice their brains,","I think."]],[3566,["(Laughter) When nothing is to be sacrificed,","why do you want to become a goat of sacrifice?"]],[3574,["So from Buddha's life, you don't have to learn","that He went in the jungles and He went, He"]],[3584,["did this and He did also renunciation."]],[3587,["He gave up his wife."]],[3590,["No!"]],[3591,["That's not needed now, that's over."]],[3599,["This is where we fail and we cannot explain","to people that those who say, \"But we must"]],[3606,["have renunciation.\""]],[3607,["Renunciation we have from within, like the","sand, as I told you."]],[3613,["Detachment we have from within."]],[3616,["But this is compassion, pure compassion is","the most detached thing."]],[3625,["Is the most detached thing is the pure compassion,","or anything pure is pure because it is detached."]],[3636,["It's a proper mathematics."]],[3640,["Anything that is pure has to be detached."]],[3642,["If it is attached it is contaminated."]],[3647,["See the logic."]],[3649,["Absolute mathematics is there."]],[3653,["If you have pure love then you are detached."]],[3656,["Now supposing you love Mother - all right,","take that."]],[3661,["Now you have say, pure love for Me, then you","won't get angry if I don't come to your house."]],[3669,["You won't feel disappointed if I can't sit","in your car."]],[3674,["You won't feel unhappy because I could not","touch your sari."]],[3678,["Because, \"I just love Mother, finished.\""]],[3681,["It ends up there."]],[3683,["Just pure love."]],[3686,["Of course, I know these weaknesses, so I try","to please you, all right, all right."]],[3691,["But actually, if you really love Me, \"It's","all right, I love Her, and She loves me, finished."]],[3698,["Whether She comes to my house or not, whether","She gives me a present or not, whether She"]],[3705,["pats me or not, whether I can see Her or not,","whether I can meet Her or not."]],[3711,["Makes no difference, I love Her.\""]],[3713,["That's the purity of love."]],[3715,["Where there's no expectation of any kind,","except that I love and that love is the ocean"]],[3721,["of enjoyment and the ocean of bliss, finished."]],[3728,["Is the easiest thing to do, is to love."]],[3735,["Just love."]],[3739,["How your heart increases like an ocean - I","just love."]],[3747,["The sea is not attached to any shore."]],[3751,["When it has to come, it comes out, when it","has to go back, it goes back."]],[3756,["When it has to give water for the rain, it","gives."]],[3759,["The water goes as the clouds are formed, then","the water falls as rain, again it comes back"]],[3766,["to the sea."]],[3767,["It doesn't stop anywhere."]],[3771,["In the same way, if we just think, \"Is the feeling","I have that I love Mother."]],[3780,["What a feeling it is.\""]],[3781,["That should be the end of everything, absolutely."]],[3790,["I feel the same way; otherwise I would be","feeling every day guilty, \"Oh, I didn't smile"]],[3797,["at that, I didn't give a present to this one."]],[3800,["I should have brought something special for","that person."]],[3804,["I was late for the program.\""]],[3806,["(Laughter) But I","don't feel guilty because it's all managed."]],[3817,["If I had come earlier, all these hecklers","would have been there to trouble us."]],[3823,["So all the horrible people disappeared and","we had the right people."]],[3826,["Then I set down through."]],[3829,["I didn't say, \"I'm going back.\""]],[3832,["There is no need to be nervous."]],[3833,["If Mother is late, there must be some plan."]],[3838,["If She is early, there must be some plan."]],[3841,["If She's going by this plane and not by the","other, there must be some plan."]],[3847,["Not to doubt it."]],[3849,["If She's doing something, must be some plan."]],[3851,["You know, Mother has Her own plans."]],[3855,["Is a nice idea to think like that."]],[3858,["\"She has Her own plans, you know.\""]],[3862,["Once you start feeling that way, such security","and such beautiful peace will spread in your"]],[3870,["being."]],[3871,["And you will be quite satisfied."]],[3874,["Now, everybody brings food for Me, look at","that."]],[3878,["I mean, when I see that I get a fright, baba."]],[3884,["(Laughter) I mean, look at that!"]],[3889,["I'm supposed to taste it, but even tasting","will be so much."]],[3897,["(Laughter) But I've to eat, you know, because","if I don't touch one of them, then they will"]],[3906,["think, \"Why didn't Mother touch?"]],[3907,["Must be something wrong.\""]],[3908,["(Laughter) This is a very big problem for","Me, to keep you happy and to assure you."]],[3921,["But I assure you that I love you all very","much!!"]],[3924,["Whether you bring food for Me, or flowers","for Me or anything."]],[3930,["Does not matter."]],[3931,["When I'm leaving Bogota, My heart is wrenching","out, I've seen the wrench of My heart, I've"]],[3939,["seen."]],[3940,["Because I'm leaving all the new babes there,","that's all."]],[3944,["Then I just don't want to face, I mean, the","thing, I feel, \"Oh God, just see I'm leaving"]],[3951,["them.\""]],[3952,["But, because I love them."]],[3956,["So I see, because I love them I feel it, so","it's all right, even this pain is all right, because"]],[3964,["I love them."]],[3966,["I enjoy that pain because I love them."]],[3971,["And then I come here and see all of you standing","at the airport."]],[3974,["Whole thing is fulfilled again."]],[3977,["Just not because you have come - because I","have come to love you."]],[3986,["All this is such a beautiful rapport and such","a beautiful feeling."]],[3992,["I want you all to enjoy this and not petty","things and small things which spoil your joy."]],[3999,["These are all joy killers and that's why the","greatest joy killer is the ego nonsensical,"]],[4006,["which tells you, \"Oh, why didn't Mother do","this or do that?\""]],[4010,["It's the ego part of it."]],[4013,["That's why we have to think of Buddha and","celebrate his Jayanti within ourselves to"]],[4017,["establish Him to say that, \"This ego cannot","take away our joy.\""]],[4027,["Anywhere such idea just comes into your head","tell them, \"Now Mister ego, I know you very"]],[4033,["well!\""]],[4034,["(Laughter) In the light of Buddha you can","see your ego very clearly."]],[4040,["And He's the killer of your ego, He's the","one who finishes off your ego."]],[4044,["So today we have to pray for the whole of","America which is really suffering from this"]],[4053,["nonsensical, mythical ego, which is being","exploited by everyone."]],[4058,["People are befooling them, the media is befooling,","all the doctors are befooling, all the psychologists"]],[4063,["are befooling, all the governments are befooling."]],[4067,["I mean, I don't know, everybody is befooled,","because they've got ego."]],[4071,["If they had no ego, they could not have been","befooled."]],[4074,["All these advertisements and all this hocus-pocus","that's going on, is because human beings have"]],[4082,["ego and they can't see it."]],[4086,["So we have to say, \"Mother, please take away","this curse of ego from Americans and America.\""]],[4094,["That's why it is nice today we have this Buddha","Puja."]],[4100,["May God bless you!"]]]);
